{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 42,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.12979888916016,
        27.289522171020508,
        340.4130554199219,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "RECOMMENDATIONS FOR MANAGEMENT OF COMMON CHILDHOOD CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        60.173309326171875,
        322.7059631347656,
        73.36231231689453
      ],
      "text": "5.5\t Empirical antibiotics for suspected neonatal sepsis",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        76.79890441894531,
        399.12286376953125,
        90.28890228271484
      ],
      "text": "a)\t Neonates with signs of sepsis should be treated with ampicillin (or penicillin) and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        89.79890441894531,
        338.8115539550781,
        103.28890228271484
      ],
      "text": "gentamicin as the first line antibiotic treatment for at least 10 days.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        105.20362091064453,
        262.9828186035156,
        119.12361907958984
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        121.46821594238281,
        399.0627746582031,
        134.95822143554688
      ],
      "text": "b)\tIf a neonate with sepsis is at greater risk of staphylococcus infection (e.g. extensive",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        134.4682159423828,
        399.121337890625,
        147.95822143554688
      ],
      "text": "skin pustules, abscess, or omphalitis in addition to signs of sepsis), should be given",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        147.4682159423828,
        326.86151123046875,
        160.95822143554688
      ],
      "text": "cloxacillin and gentamicin instead of penicillin and gentamicin.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        162.87289428710938,
        229.02288818359375,
        176.79290771484375
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, expert opinion)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        179.1374969482422,
        399.0326843261719,
        192.62750244140625
      ],
      "text": "c)\t Where possible, blood cultures should be obtained before starting antibiotics. If",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        192.1374969482422,
        399.1114501953125,
        205.62750244140625
      ],
      "text": "an infant does not improve in 2–3 days, antibiotic treatment should be changed,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        205.1374969482422,
        371.3915100097656,
        218.62750244140625
      ],
      "text": "or the infant should be referred to a neonatologist for further management.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        220.54208374023438,
        229.02288818359375,
        234.46209716796875
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, expert opinion)",
      "font": "MinionPro-BoldIt",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        236.8068084716797,
        399.04278564453125,
        250.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "In making this recommendation, the panel considered the high antimicrobial",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        249.8068084716797,
        399.07281494140625,
        263.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "sensitivity to third generation cephalosporins, and the lack of enough evidence to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        262.8067932128906,
        399.10272216796875,
        276.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "choose between beta-lactams plus gentamicin and 3rd generation cephalosporins.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        275.8067932128906,
        396.8728332519531,
        289.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "In developing countries, streptococci continue to be highly sensitive to beta-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        288.67681884765625,
        399.1253967285156,
        302.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "staphylococcus aureus lactams, although sensitivity to gentamicin of   (40–95%) and",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        301.8067932128906,
        399.09283447265625,
        315.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "gram negative enteric bacteria (32–100%) is variable. In order to guide empirical",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        314.8067932128906,
        399.06298828125,
        328.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "prescribing, it is crucial to monitor changes in the pattern of causative organisms and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        327.8067932128906,
        399.102783203125,
        341.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "their antimicrobial susceptibility profiles since the effects may depend on antibiotic",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        340.8067932128906,
        150.89291381835938,
        354.29681396484375
      ],
      "text": "susceptibility patterns.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        365.3254089355469,
        233.98292541503906,
        377.3153991699219
      ],
      "text": "5.5.1\t Evidence and summary of findings",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        380.97998046875,
        399.1203918457031,
        394.4700012207031
      ],
      "text": "The evidence for these recommendations are from two existing Cochrane reviews",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        393.97998046875,
        399.1329345703125,
        407.4700012207031
      ],
      "text": "that have concluded there is not enough evidence to choose between different",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        406.97998046875,
        399.1330261230469,
        420.4700012207031
      ],
      "text": "antibiotic combinations for first line treatment of early or late neonatal sepsis",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        419.97998046875,
        399.1029357910156,
        433.4700012207031
      ],
      "text": "[Mtitima, 2004; Gordon, 2005]. Sepsis in neonates is classified as early (presenting",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        432.97998046875,
        399.1427917480469,
        446.4700012207031
      ],
      "text": "within 72 hours after birth) and late (presenting after 72 hours after birth) because",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        445.8500061035156,
        399.1353759765625,
        459.4700012207031
      ],
      "text": "Group B  this predicts aetiology. In early sepsis the most common organisms are",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        458.8500061035156,
        399.12347412109375,
        472.4700012207031
      ],
      "text": "streptococcus E. coli  and gram negative enteric bacteria (esp.  ). Late onset community",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        471.8500061035156,
        399.1271057128906,
        485.4700012207031
      ],
      "text": "Strep. Pneumoniae Staphylococcus  acquired infections are predominantly caused by  ,",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        484.8500061035156,
        222.232666015625,
        498.4700012207031
      ],
      "text": "aureus E. coli ,   and other gram negatives.",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        497.97998046875,
        399.11151123046875,
        511.4700012207031
      ],
      "text": "The evidence is from four RCTs of 3rd generation cephalosporin monotherapy",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        510.97998046875,
        399.1026916503906,
        524.469970703125
      ],
      "text": "versus penicillin and aminoglycoside combination that were identified. One of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        523.97998046875,
        399.0627746582031,
        537.469970703125
      ],
      "text": "these was conducted in South Africa and all others were conducted in Europe.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        536.97998046875,
        399.1029052734375,
        550.469970703125
      ],
      "text": "Two trials used cefotaxime and the other two used ceftazidime monotherapy as the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        549.97998046875,
        399.07293701171875,
        563.469970703125
      ],
      "text": "intervention. Three trials used ampicillin or benzyl penicillin with gentamicin as",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        562.97998046875,
        399.0928649902344,
        576.469970703125
      ],
      "text": "the control treatment, while one trial used penicillin with netilmicin as the control",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        300.5552978515625,
        575.7601318359375,
        391.6451721191406,
        589.4700927734375
      ],
      "text": "see GRADE table A7.4",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        575.9801025390625,
        399.1164855957031,
        589.4700927734375
      ],
      "text": "treatment. The overall quality of evidence was graded as low ( ).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        588.9801025390625,
        399.0513916015625,
        602.4700927734375
      ],
      "text": "Mortality and cure rates were similar between intervention and control groups",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        601.9801025390625,
        399.06292724609375,
        615.4700927734375
      ],
      "text": "in three of the four studies. However, there was a significantly higher cure rate in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        614.9801025390625,
        399.0927734375,
        628.4700927734375
      ],
      "text": "the South African study. Overall, there was no difference in mortality or cure rates",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        222.4506072998047,
        644.9403076171875,
        230.59561157226562,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "28",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}